# Learned Rules

Rules auto-captured from user corrections. Tagged with `[BIZ]`/`[DEV]`/`[ALL]` for domain filtering.

## Verification Rules

- [FABRICATION] [BIZ] Never fabricate personas or present AI-generated profiles as real people. Do Duc Quang was fabricated — always verify persona existence. (source: user-correction, date: 2026-03-09)
- [METRICS] [BIZ] Never inflate performance metrics. Cold Email King open rates were inflated from 15-18% to 23% — use conservative real numbers. (source: user-correction, date: 2026-03-09)
- [QUOTES] [BIZ] Never present misleading financial quotes. Hormozi $46.2M was equity sale, not gym revenue — always clarify context. (source: user-correction, date: 2026-03-09)
- [SOURCES] [BIZ] Never present unverifiable origin stories as fact. Jack Ma origin stories — label unverified claims explicitly. (source: user-correction, date: 2026-03-09)
- [FILES] [ALL] Never skip MANDATORY LOAD files. Buffett failures-learned.md was missing despite being required — always verify file existence before claiming loaded. (source: user-correction, date: 2026-03-09)

## Product Research Anti-Confirmation Rules

- [MOAT-CHECK] [BIZ] Never claim "data moat" without specifying: what data, how collected, why competitors can't replicate within 6 months. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [BASE-RATE] [BIZ] Never project revenue without citing base rate failure statistics for that specific industry/model. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [COMPETITOR-DEEP] [BIZ] Never claim "no one does X" without searching ProductHunt, G2, Capterra, and GitHub for alternatives. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [PRICING-REALITY] [BIZ] Never set price without evidence of actual willingness-to-pay from forums, competitor pricing pages, or survey data. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [CHANNEL-DECAY] [BIZ] Never claim affiliate/channel revenue without modeling 20-40% annual decay rate. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [BIG-TECH-CHECK] [BIZ] Never dismiss Big Tech competition without checking their recent product launches, acquisitions, and patent filings. (source: anti-confirmation-protocol, date: 2026-03-14)
- [EVIDENCE-RISK] [BIZ] Risk assessment must be evidence-based — discover risks from real market data (failures, complaints, regulatory actions), not from template queries. (source: v17-gap-fix, date: 2026-04-06)
- [AI-DISRUPTION] [BIZ] Never claim service business viability without checking "AI replace [service] 2026" and "AI tools [category] free". TikTok MCN playbook claimed "brands can't create content" — CapCut AI + TikTok Symphony let brands create pro-level videos free. (source: playbook-audit, date: 2026-03-29)

## Live Commerce / Creator Economy Anti-Optimism Rules
- [CONFABULATION-BAN] [BIZ] Never present specific numeric claims (X% take rate, $Y median income, Z-year window) without a named, dated, URL-linked source. Megapolo audit found "20-30%→8-12% take rate" and "$200-420 median streamer income" were both confabulated. Tag uncited numerics as [?] and never anchor recommendations on them. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [GMV-INCOME-DIVISION] [BIZ] Mandatory math for every live commerce / creator economy analysis: GMV × commission_rate ÷ active_affiliate_count = expected_individual_share. If <$100/mo for median entrant, state explicitly BEFORE any positive framing. Megapolo analysis cited $46.1M Brazil GMV without dividing — actual median affiliate share is ~$0. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [FOUNDER-REALITY-GATE] [BIZ] Before recommending any opportunity door, audit founder constraints: audience size, language for target market, capital, location-edge. CLOSE doors that cannot be opened, do not just rank them. Megapolo analysis recommended "sell training" (Door C) to a zero-audience founder — Door C requires prior credibility that founder lacked. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [FAILURE-ARCHAEOLOGY-MANDATORY] [BIZ] Failure search is required, not optional. Search "[model] closed" / "[model] failed" / "[model] bankrupt" BEFORE supporting evidence. If zero failures retrieved, state "absence of evidence is not evidence of safety, data gap acknowledged." Hangzhou Jiubao collapsed 600 MCN → 33 MCN (94%) but original analysis missed it. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [CROSS-BORDER-LANGUAGE-GATE] [BIZ] Cross-border creator/commerce recommendations require explicit language acquisition path. Vietnamese founder + Portuguese market = +3 difficulty multiplier. Recommending "build Brazil training business" to a no-Portuguese founder is structurally unsound. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [POWER-LAW-MEDIAN-WARNING] [BIZ] In creator economies the power law is more extreme than general business (~1% capture 70-80% of income). Always cite the MODE (most common outcome ~$0-50/mo), not just the median or mean. China Performing Arts data: 36.9% of streamers earn <1,000 RMB/month ($140). (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)
- [HUB-OPERATOR-VS-AFFILIATE] [BIZ] In wholesale-to-livestream-hub models, the operator wins from VOLUME OF ATTEMPTS, not affiliate success. Never frame "operator model sustainable" as a positive signal for the affiliate-side founder — the two are different sides of an extractive trade. (source: megapolo-audit, date: 2026-04-10)

## Exhaustive Research Rules (Non-Google Source Ladder)

- [EXHAUSTIVE-RESEARCH] [ALL] When `/stage0`, `/ck:brainstorm`, `/ck:opportunity`, or any analytical command fires on a topic with grey-hat / VN-market / operator-layer / technical-niche / competitor-intel keywords, Google WebSearch is INSUFFICIENT as primary research. MANDATORY ladder: (1) classify topic into `data/knowledge-sources/research-ladder.json` route, (2) fire `python data/knowledge-sources/ladder-runner.py --topic "<topic>" --route <route_key>` to probe 15-25 non-Google sources in parallel, (3) apply value gate (≥3 unique specific data points = drill, else skip), (4) deep-drill every drill-recommended source via WebFetch / yt-dlp / tikwm / agent-browser, (5) cite which tiers were probed / drilled / skipped in final output. Google gives MARKETING about the topic; this ladder gives OPERATOR DEBATE about the topic. Never conclude research done based solely on WebSearch. (source: ugblackmmo-content-extraction-gap, date: 2026-04-11)
- [LADDER-VALUE-GATE] [ALL] Do not waste tokens scraping every source indiscriminately. At each ladder rung, probe with a SINGLE lowest-cost query. Count signals matching: dollar_amount, dated_event, named_entity, tool_or_product, url_verified, ban_platform_mention, failure_example. If count ≥3, drill until signal-per-query drops below 1 unique datapoint per 5 min reading. If count <3, log and skip to next source. This is a GATED crawler, not a blind scraper. (source: ugblackmmo-content-extraction-gap, date: 2026-04-11)
- [LADDER-CITATION] [ALL] Final analytical output MUST include a "Research tiers fired" section listing: tiers probed, sources drilled (with URLs), sources skipped (with reason), sources errored (HTTP code). Makes research phase auditable. No invisible research. (source: ugblackmmo-content-extraction-gap, date: 2026-04-11)
- [GOOGLE-SEO-SATURATION] [ALL] If top 10 Google WebSearch results for topic return ≥6 SEO-optimized / course-funnel / affiliate-blog-spam entries, Google is structurally compromised for this topic. IMMEDIATELY escalate to non-Google ladder without further WebSearch. Signal: all results are blog posts with lists, no forum links, no dated dashboards, no operator-layer content. (source: ugblackmmo-content-extraction-gap, date: 2026-04-11)
- [FORUM-LAYER-PRIORITY] [BIZ] For VN-market topics, forum-layer sources (mmo4me.com, voz.vn, vn-z.vn, tinhte.vn) outrank Google results by signal density. Drill forums BEFORE WebSearch. For Chinese-market topics, V2EX + 52pojie + Zhihu outrank Western Google. Language friction is the price of non-SEO-polluted operator debate. (source: ugblackmmo-content-extraction-gap, date: 2026-04-11)

## Tool-Exhaustion / Execution-Mindset Rules

- [TOOL-EXHAUSTION] [ALL] Before concluding "X is not feasible / inaccessible / blocked", you MUST exhaust ≥4 distinct tool paths and document each attempt. For content access specifically (web, social, API): (1) WebFetch, (2) yt-dlp or equivalent extractor, (3) direct HTML fetch + parse embedded JSON, (4) 3rd-party proxy API (tikwm for TikTok, snaptik, ssstik, etc.), (5) browser automation (agent-browser/chrome-devtools/Playwright), (6) Claude multimodal vision via Read on downloaded assets, (7) ai-multimodal skill (Gemini). A single failed WebFetch is NOT "blocked". (source: ugblackmmo-stage0-shortcut-bug, date: 2026-04-11)
- [CONTENT-LAYER-MANDATORY] [BIZ] For any channel/founder/creator analysis, direct content-layer scrape (metadata + OCR + comments) is BLOCKING before pattern-match inference. Publishing "the channel probably teaches X" without reading the actual content = fabrication. If content is genuinely unreachable after full tool exhaustion, state explicitly "content layer unavailable after 5 tool paths tried: [list]" and degrade to labeled inference with [?] tags — do not silently promote inference to fact. (source: ugblackmmo-stage0-shortcut-bug, date: 2026-04-11)
- [STAGE0-PROFILE-BLOCKING] [BIZ] stage0 Step 1 (profile capture) is BLOCKING and MUST run before any analysis. If interactive capture is not possible (autonomous mode, memory-inferred profile), write a profile file with all required fields + explicit `_needs_validation: [...]` gaps list + `_effects_on_analysis: {...}` conditional branches. NEVER hard-code defaults silently. NEVER skip. (source: ugblackmmo-stage0-shortcut-bug, date: 2026-04-11)
- [TIKTOK-SCRAPE-STACK] [BIZ] TikTok-specific scrape stack for VN content analysis (verified working 2026-04): (1) `yt-dlp --flat-playlist --dump-json` for full profile listing, (2) `yt-dlp --write-info-json --skip-download` per-post for basic meta+audio, (3) `https://www.tikwm.com/api/?url=X&hd=1` for full post data INCLUDING all photo-slideshow slide URLs, (4) `https://www.tikwm.com/api/comment/list/?url=X&count=30` for comments. Rate limit: ≥1.6s between calls. The cover-thumbnail limitation of yt-dlp's TikTok extractor means photo posts MUST use tikwm for full slide access. (source: ugblackmmo-stage0-shortcut-bug, date: 2026-04-11)
- [EXECUTION-MINDSET-ENFORCEMENT] [ALL] CLAUDE.md Execution Mindset Rule ("NEVER conclude not feasible, ALWAYS find a way") is violated implicitly any time a tool failure leads to degraded analysis without explicit tool-path exhaustion log. Make the log explicit. State "tried A, tried B, tried C" even when all succeed — it trains the habit of exhaustion before conclusion. (source: ugblackmmo-stage0-shortcut-bug, date: 2026-04-11)

## Infrastructure Freeze Rules

- [INFRA-FREEZE] [ALL] No new pipeline versions (V20+), no new brain phases, no new personas until 10+ deals tracked with outcomes in data/deals/. Only allowed: bug fixes, integration with deal tracker/blueprint synthesizer. 1,259 scripts exist — system needs USAGE DATA from real deals, not more scripts. (source: execution-evolution-audit, date: 2026-05-09)
